  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): enhance LuciferModel with zero-allocation expression compilation\n\n      Summary of changes:\n      - Feature: Added `SetModelI<TService, TImplementation=\"\">` and `SetModelT<TService, TImplementation=\"\">` generic overloads for clean, type-safe registration.\n      - Performance: Shifted reflection operations from resolve-time (`GetModelT`) to register-time (`SetModelT`) using pre-compiled Expression Trees.\n      - Optimization: Leveraged `FastActivator<T>` for zero-allocation parameterless constructor invocation.\n      - Docs: Restored and added full XML summary documentation across all `LuciferModel` public methods.",
